{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","goal":"Prepare an evidence-limited inspection handoff. The numerical acceptance interval is [12.48,12.52] mm, inclusive. Interval inclusion is arithmetic only, not physical validation.","ops":{"fields":"Return a compact JSON array of strings containing the reference's length, uncertainty, n, method, basis, physical_validation, in that order, preserving field values exactly.","interval":"Return a compact JSON array [length-uncertainty,length+uncertainty], each formatted as a string with two decimal places and unit mm. If uncertainty is unknown, return unknown.","unk":"Return a compact JSON array of field names whose values are unknown, in this order: uncertainty, method, basis.","incl":"Return inside if the entire length +/- uncertainty interval lies within the goal's acceptance interval [12.48,12.52] mm inclusive; outside otherwise. If uncertainty is unknown, return unknown."},"refs":{"1":{"path":"refs/1.txt"},"2":{"path":"refs/2.txt"},"3":{"path":"refs/3.txt"},"4":{"path":"refs/4.txt"}},"jobs":[["ma_01","fields","1"],["ma_02","interval","1"],["ma_03","unk","1"],["ma_04","incl","1"],["ma_05","fields","2"],["ma_06","interval","2"],["ma_07","unk","2"],["ma_08","incl","2"],["ma_09","fields","3"],["ma_10","interval","3"],["ma_11","unk","3"],["ma_12","incl","3"],["ma_13","fields","4"],["ma_14","interval","4"],["ma_15","unk","4"],["ma_16","incl","4"]]}
